OL,3,GNEWSAWater system a 'disaster', Green
OL,4,Adeputy leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen Party co-deputy leader Rachel
OL,7,FMillward has said her party would
OL,8,Fnationalise water companies in England
OL,9,Fand Wales, criticising Prime Minister
OL,10,FAndy Burnham's plans to bring them
OL,11,Funder public control as "vague".
OL,13,FMillward told the BBC the country's
OL,14,Fwater system was an "absolutely
OL,15,Funmitigated disaster", arguing there
OL,16,Fhad been "radical underinvestment" over
OL,17,Fdecades.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
