OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWater system a 'disaster', Green
OL,4,Adeputy leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said Burnham's plan, which involves
OL,7,Fremoving limits on government ownership
OL,8,Fof shares in water companies and giving
OL,9,Fmayors more powers to scrutinise them,
OL,10,Fdid not go far enough.
OL,12,FThe Green Party of England and Wales
OL,13,Fhas long called for public ownership of
OL,14,Fwater companies, describing
OL,15,Fprivatisation as a failed experiment.
